<title>THAILAND: Berli Jucker secures $45 million loan.</title>
<headline>Berli Jucker secures $45 million loan.</headline>
<text>
<p>BANGKOK, April 25 (April) - Thailand's Berli Jucker Plc said it will sign a $45 million loan deal with Hong Kong lender BA Asia Ltd on April 28, the firm said in statement issued on Friday.</p>
<p>The cost of the five-year loan is 60 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate (LIBOR) with proceeds being used for refinancing, the statement said without giving further details.</p>
</text>
